@startuml
title Routing eines Client-Aufrufs über einen bereits aktiven Stream

autonumber
hide footbox

actor Client
participant "DeviceIntegrationServiceProxy\n(Client.Contracts)" as ClientProxy
participant DeviceIntegrationService as ClientService
participant IntegrationDeviceCatalog as Catalog
participant JobFacade as Facade
participant "StreamTrackingJobTransmitter\n<ReadValue>" as TrackingTx
participant "JobTransmitter\n<ReadValue>" as InnerTx
participant DeviceIntegrationWorkerService as WorkerService
participant "WorkerServiceProxy\n(Integration.Contracts)" as WorkerProxy
participant DeviceIntegrationWorker as Worker
participant IDeviceIntegration as Integration

Client -> ClientProxy : ReadValue(deviceId)
ClientProxy -> ClientService : unary gRPC-Aufruf
ClientService -> Catalog : ResolveService(deviceId)
Catalog --> ClientService : service
ClientService -> Facade : QueueJobAndWaitForResult(service, request)
Facade -> TrackingTx : TransmitJobAndWaitForResult(...)
TrackingTx -> InnerTx : unverändert delegieren
InnerTx --> WorkerService : Request im vorhandenen Stream
WorkerService --> WorkerProxy : gRPC-Nachricht
WorkerProxy --> Worker : JobRequest<ReadValueRequest>
Worker -> Integration : ReadValue(request, token)
Integration --> Worker : value
Worker -> WorkerProxy : SendReadValueResult(result)
WorkerProxy -> WorkerService : unary gRPC-Aufruf
WorkerService -> TrackingTx : NotifyJobResult(result)
TrackingTx -> InnerTx : unverändert delegieren
InnerTx --> Facade : korreliertes Ergebnis
Facade --> ClientService : value
ClientService --> ClientProxy : gRPC-Antwort
ClientProxy --> Client : value

note over TrackingTx,Worker
  Der ReadValue-Stream wurde beim Start einmal geöffnet und
  durch TrackedStream<T> dekoriert. Pro Auftrag entsteht keine neue
  Verbindung und kein neuer Methodenstream.
end note
@enduml
